#: ../../installation.rst:144
msgid "LLM 调度与本地并发控制"
msgstr "LLM Dispatch and Local Concurrency Control"

#: ../../installation.rst:146
msgid ""
"LLM 调度由可序列化的 ``LLMClient`` 完成。每个 Ray task、env router actor 或 driver "
"进程在自己的 事件循环中首次调用 LLM 时，本地创建 litellm Router 与 ``AdaptiveSemaphore``。 "
"``AdaptiveSemaphore`` 基于近期延迟和 rate-limit 错误做 AIMD 自适应并发。"
msgstr ""
"LLM dispatch is handled by serializable ``LLMClient`` instances. When "
"each Ray task, env router actor, or driver process calls an LLM for the "
"first time in its own event loop, it creates a local litellm Router and "
"``AdaptiveSemaphore``. ``AdaptiveSemaphore`` adapts concurrency with AIMD"
" based on recent latency and rate-limit errors."

#: ../../installation.rst:169
msgid ""
"``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_RAY_CONCURRENCY`` 只是 AIMD 的起点，没有人工上下限——每进程并发会 自动逼近 API"
" 真实容量并在延迟/限流恶化时回退。若网关有严格 QPS 上限可调低起点； 实际总并发还取决于同时运行的 Ray task "
"数（``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_RAY_MAX_WORKERS``）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../installation.rst:174
msgid "支持的 LLM 提供商"
msgstr "Supported LLM Providers"

#: ../../installation.rst:176
msgid ""
"AgentSociety 2 通过 LiteLLM 路由模型调用；文档中的默认示例使用 OpenAI 兼容的 Chat Completions "
"接口："
msgstr ""
"AgentSociety 2 routes model calls through LiteLLM. Default examples in "
"the docs use an OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions API:"

#: ../../installation.rst:178
msgid "``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_API_BASE=https://api.openai.com/v1``"
msgstr "``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_API_BASE=https://api.openai.com/v1``"

#: ../../installation.rst:179
msgid "``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_MODEL=gpt-5.5``"
msgstr "``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_MODEL=gpt-5.5``"

#: ../../installation.rst:181
msgid ""
"如果你使用其它 LiteLLM 支持的 OpenAI 兼容网关，请保持同样的环境变量结构，并把 "
"``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_API_BASE`` 与模型名替换为该网关提供的值。"
msgstr ""
"If you use another LiteLLM-supported OpenAI-compatible gateway, keep the "
"same variable names and set ``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_API_BASE`` and the model "
"name to values provided by that gateway."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "若你的 LLM 网关有明确的 QPS / 并发上限，优先调低 "
#~ "``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_RAY_CONCURRENCY``； 实际总并发还取决于同时运行的 Ray"
#~ " task / actor 数量。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If your LLM gateway has explicit "
#~ "QPS / concurrency limits, lower "
